<title>CHINA: China Jan-July imports of rolled steel down 17 pct.</title>
<headline>China Jan-July imports of rolled steel down 17 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>China imported 7.57 million tonnes of rolled steel in January to July this year, down 17 percent compared with the same period in 1996, customs figures showed on Friday.</p>
<p>China exported 2.30 million tonnes of rolled steel in January to July, up 6.0 percent compared with the year-ago period, the figures showed.</p>
<p>-- Beijing Newsroom 86-10-6532-1921 Fax: 86-10-6532-4978</p>
